     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Use the exponent distributive rule. When you have a fraction, <span data-math=\"\\frac{a}{b}\"></span>, raised to an exponent, <i>n</i>, then <span data-math=\"{\\left( {\\frac{a}{b}} \\right)^n} = \\frac{{{a^n}}}{{{b^n}}}\"></span>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"{\\left( {\\frac{{14}}{5}} \\right)^9} = \\frac{{{{14}^9}}}{{{5^9}}}\"></span></p>"
    },
